<p><strong>A:</strong> Minimum: ASNT SNT-TC-1A Level II certification or ISO 9712 Level 2 in this specific method. This requires 120+ hours formal training, field experience, and written/practical examination. Many companies require additional hands-on training from equipment manufacturers. ASNT Level III or ISO 9712 Level 3 required for procedure approval and technical authority.</p>

