<p>ASNT (American Society for Nondestructive Testing) SNT-TC-1A provides guidelines for personnel qualification and certification. ISO 9934 through ISO 9936 series establish testing methodology standards. AWS D1.1 covers welding standards relevant to NDT procedures. Compliance with these standards is frequently contractually required by customers.</p>

